# Wave T47 (Repose kit): oliveroof — the OLIVE WOOD SHINGLE of the Repose Daycare, worn only by the shipped Daycare stamp's th roof cells, so the painting's olive roofs land on the town's namesake building and the House + Daycare th-roof share breaks. Horizontal shingle courses in olive green, staggered butt joints, moss along the course feet. No other fleet roof is olive wood shingle: Heritage's heritageroof is teal slate courses, Inglenook's domeroof gold dome segments, Honeyfield's bloomroof petal scales, Coalseam's ironroof riveted plate. (NO-SAME-KIT law; WAVE-T47-REPOSE-PLAN.md §5.)
